og.udallas.edu/tower-thoughts/best-study-spots-on-campus","source_title":"Best Study Spots on Campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-03-11","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor setting around Braniff; the source does not state a reservation or access restriction.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"udallas-church-incarnation-lawn-amphitheater","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Church of the Incarnation Lawn and Amphitheater","title":"Church of the Incarnation Lawn and Amphitheater","subtitle":"Church of the Incarnation","notes":"Bring a group to the stone benches for an outdoor discussion, or use the lawn for independent review when weather and campus activity allow.","short_summary":"A lawn-and-stone-bench outdoor setting completed in August 2025.","evidence_claim":"University of Dallas states that the Church of the Incarnation Lawn and Amphitheater was completed in August 2025 and has stone benches suited to study groups.","source_url":"https://blog.udallas.edu/tower-thoughts/best-study-spots-on-campus","source_title":"Best Study Spots on Campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-03-11","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor lawn and amphitheater; the source does not state a reservation, purchase, or specific access restriction.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"udallas-clodfelter-childrens-literature-library","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Dr. Cherie A. Clodfelter Children's Literature Library","title":"Clodfelter Children's Literature Library","subtitle":"Lower Level, Braniff Graduate Building","notes":"Use this quiet library environment for education-related reading and curriculum research; plan a weekday visit and leave food and drinks outside the space.","short_summary":"A 12,000-volume chi